sequenceDiagram
    participant KAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconcilers as Discovery Reconcilers<br/>(HPA/IP/SO/CM)
    participant DS as In-Memory Datastore
    participant SatEng as Saturation Engine<br/>(15s/60s loop)
    participant SFZEng as Scale-from-Zero Engine
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos<br/>9090-9091/TCP HTTPS

    Note over KAPI,Reconcilers: Flow 2: Model Discovery via Reconcilers

    KAPI->>Reconcilers: Watch events (HPAs, InferencePools,<br/>ScaledObjects, ConfigMaps)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Reconcilers->>DS: Register model entries<br/>(model_id + namespace key)

    Note over SatEng,Prom: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Loop

    loop Every 15s (K8s) / 60s (OpenShift)
        SatEng->>DS: Read model list & config
        SatEng->>Prom: Query KV cache utilization,<br/>queue depth, throughput<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / Bearer token
        Prom-->>SatEng: Metric values
        SatEng->>SatEng: Analyze saturation<br/>(V2 token/capacity analyzer)
        SatEng->>KAPI: Patch Deployment/LWS scale<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    Note over SFZEng,KAPI: Scale-from-Zero (Cold Start)

    SFZEng->>DS: Check for zero-replica models
    SFZEng->>KAPI: Patch scale subresource<br/>(dynamic client)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token

    Note over KAPI,Prom: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping

    participant PromMon as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)
    PromMon->>SatEng: Scrape :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS TLS / Bearer token + TokenReview/SAR
    SatEng-->>PromMon: Controller metrics
